---
import { METHODOLOGY } from '../../data/methodology';

/** Who has the final word on a verdict, from most authority to least. Numbered because the order is the point. */
---

<figure class="authority">
  <ol class="authority__list">
    {
      METHODOLOGY.authority.map((layer, index) => (
        <li class={`authority__layer authority__layer--${index + 1}`}>
          <span class="authority__num" aria-hidden="true">
            {index + 1}
          </span>
          <span class="authority__text">
            <span class="authority__title">{layer.title}</span>
            <span class="authority__body">{layer.body}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="authority__power">{layer.power}</span>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>
  <figcaption class="chart__note">
    Most authority at the top. Passing the scripts isn't the same as working: they passed one model on 49 of 49 plugins, and 38 held
    up on the Dell and a code read.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
